## How to Extend

### Add New Commands

Edit the `message` event listener in "Super bot ahad":

```javascript
client.on('message', message => {
    if (message.body === '!yourcommand') {
        message.reply('Your response here');
    }
});
```

### Common Use Cases

- **Auto-replies:** Set up automatic responses to specific messages
- **Message forwarding:** Forward messages to multiple contacts
- **Scheduled messages:** Send messages at specific times
- **Group management:** Control group settings and member actions

